---
// Editorial breather — two-tone heading like the reference (muted lead, solid emphasis).
---
<section class="mx-auto max-w-[1400px] px-6 sm:px-10 pt-16 sm:pt-24 pb-6 sm:pb-8 border-t border-line">
  <div data-reveal class="max-w-4xl">
    <p class="text-fog tracking-[0.25em] uppercase text-[11px] mb-6 flex items-center gap-3">
      <span class="h-px w-7 bg-accent inline-block"></span> The approach
    </p>
    <p class="font-display font-medium text-3xl sm:text-5xl leading-[1.12] tracking-[-0.02em] text-fog">
      Nothing beats freezing the moment everyone's going to remember —
      <span class="text-bone">the big plays, the real emotion, the stuff you'll want to look back on.</span>
      Shot clean. That's what I'm here for.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
